{#
  A total action's quantity: read-only, because the action always claims every
  hectare available on the parcel rather than an amount the user types. The
  figure is kept in step with other selections by select-actions-page.js, which
  addresses the value by displayId.
#}
<p class="govuk-body select-actions-chosen-area__label">Quantity</p>
<p class="govuk-body govuk-!-font-weight-bold select-actions-chosen-area__value" id="{{ displayId }}">{{ areaText }}</p>
